<title>UK: C&amp;W cuts stake in Sweden's NetCom.</title>
<headline>C&amp;W cuts stake in Sweden's NetCom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British telecoms group Cable and Wireless Plc said on Wednesday that it has sold just over half its stake in Sweden's NetCom Systems, resulting in a gain of 40 million stg in the current year.</p>
</text>
